                      "text": "The Sender Authentication Package (<u><strong><span class=\"article-text-purple\">SAP</span></strong><span class=\"article-text-purple\"></span></u>) is a branding feature that allows you to customize an authenticated domain, distinctively labeling links and images for the SFMC org you’re sending emails from.",
