                "type": "solo-text",
                "data": {
                  "paragraphs": [
                    {
                      "text": "Salesforce provides and promotes the use of security measures such as <a href=\"https://support.google.com/a/answer/33786?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-rich-link article-rich-link--gold\">SPF</a>, <a href=\"https://support.google.com/a/answer/174124?hl=en&amp;ref_topic=9061731&amp;sjid=17042629836607995288-NC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-rich-link article-rich-link--gold\">DKIM</a> and <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/exchange/antispam-and-antimalware/antispam-protection/sender-id?view=exchserver-2019\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-rich-link\">Sender ID</a> to guarantee the legitimacy of your emails and protect against phishing attempts.",
