                    {
                      "text": "<span class=\"article-text-purple\">CloudPages</span> is the name Salesforce uses for referring to <span class=\"article-text-muted\">Landing Pages</span>.Additionally, the <strong><u>cloud</u></strong> domain is enabled via the SSL Certificates.",
